          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Indi nukuhosha mwekwawu mudihi? Muloŋa nabuli mpinji yasushimuna nsaŋu jaGideyona, naBaraka, naSamisoni, naYefwata; naDavidi naSamweli nawatuprofwetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenawa emikili mawanta mushindu nakukuhwelela, elili mwaya kuloŋa, atambwili yikaninu, ajikili tunwa twawanyitupa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ajimini Ŋovu jakesi, apulukili kuyitapa nampoku yakabali, hazeyeluwu akwatili Ŋovu, elili ayilobu kunjita, atemwini majita awantu akumatuŋa acheŋi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ambanda atambwili afu awu chakusaŋuka mukufwa. Amakwawu ayihumpwili humpule-e nichafwiluwu, hiyetejeli kuyipulwishaku, kulonda akamoni kusaŋuka kwabadika kuwaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amakwawu ayikabishili nakuyiyiŋila nikuyijipola yikoti, eŋaŋi, ninyonji nituleya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayasoleli malola, ayiketoleli ngwa ngwa, ayesekeli, ayitapoleli nampoku yakabali. Akimbokeli nakuvwala yitembi yawanyikoku niyawampembi; asheli kwamakasamunshiŋu; ayi mwesheli lukadi, ayikoŋeli chatama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpata yamunu mwishina hiyateleleli wena kushakama mwoku. Akimbokelaŋa nakululuta mwakadi meji, nihamapidi, nakwiŋela mumayeŋu nimumena amumaseki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
